'''{{PAGENAME}}''' are a special type of [[Realm]] where you can earn [[#Delusions|Delusions]], and [[Enhanced]] Spells. They do not adhere to normal Realm rules.

Accessing different Quasi-Realms require different total amount of [[Memories]] earned, with some having additional prerequisites.

